<<~ ahu #/held-integrities>>
!! What the machina currently enacts

* ''One OODA-HA helm.'' Location, epoch, candidate, capability and final-gallery
  loops run through projection_loom.fractal_ooda_ha.run_ooda_epochs. Child inquiries MAY
  open under any active phase; parent phases hold until their children close.
  Do not introduce a parallel compound epoch scheduler.
* ''Each entity carries only useful capabilities.'' A Crystal MAY run CAD cage
  -> CAD-derived polymesh -> protected semantic socket. Joining MAY hold CAD
  contacts with optional polymesh skin. Fortress MAY hold CAD and carved voids.
  Nameless entities MAY hold standalone meshes. A location keeps their relations.
* ''Lineage inherits recipes.'' The selected bounded compound genome preserves
  CAD loci, mesh loci, a recipe digest, source hashes, and trusted operator
  fingerprints. Baked STEP/OBJ outputs never become the authoritative genome.
* ''Kernel truth remains scoped.'' A one-solid BRep audit proves its own CAD;
  polygon watertightness proves a surface property; a semantic socket measures
  proximity. Their composite visualization never claims an exact fused
  CAD+mesh solid or structural loading certificate.
* ''Operator judgment survives autonomy.'' Manual/co-pilot/auto-nav/full-speed
  share controls for pause, review, choose, pet-name, o-takiage, inquiry and
  steering. Optional Ollama/OpenAI-compatible advice enters a guarded boundary.
* ''One painting carries provisional testimony.'' Exact original Necrospire
  RGBA+L8 alpha live in examples/necrospire. Its fixed oblique camera does not
  carry independent survey registration.

<<~/ahu>>

