<<~ ahu #/post-move-engineering-roadmap>>

!! Projection Loom · after o-takiage, next OODA-HA program

''Provenance.'' PR #84 is the working home. The operator directed both code-scope correction and nested carrier siting. Commit `9f16a30b` returned the sole unrelated browser-code delta to the PR merge-base wording. Commit `0bdfb782` moved 13 API memes into `bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/projection-loom/` and two docs into `bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/projection-loom/`, readdressed and checksum-sealed; later bridge edits adjusted the README, checks and dedicated CI. The original bytes/identity stand on `archive/pr84-before-projection-loom-carrier-move-20261031`. New identity is source-sited; no old URI compatibility alias was minted.

''Next waves, in working order.''

# First earn the exact-head green gate. Check native CAD/evidence, general CI, held-out witnesses, scene/blender workflow and the new carrier-siting/link gate at the same final commit. Repair actual regressions without claiming older heads certify newer ones.
# Produce one independent three-epoch STEP heredity witness in the existing `fractal_ooda_ha.OODAHAJournal`. Freeze the source `PlaceGenome + SpatialIntent` and original connect/shelter/ascend/bear obligations; mutate a complete, already native-admitted parent route region into a distinct child, independently reimport STEP on each admitted generation, verify provenance/digest/equal budgets, and prove deterministic replay. A route-family descriptor remains a derived witness, never a second mutable helm. Construction refusal, native rejection, deferral and admission remain distinct.
# Add adversarial and held-out source-conditioned route tests: obstruction refusal before output roots exist, body preservation, test fixed-source two-/three-hop alternatives, camera digest stability, gallery regeneration and no automatic aesthetic winner. Run feature then Aftermath/L-prime on each completed tranche.
# Only after native heredity proof consider semantic reconstruction as a second strategy under the same derived descriptor and receipt contract. Compare with direct parent-region mutation on equal native budgets; preserve the earlier reconstruction-first dissent as testimony.
# Tackle real source-image/DEM orientation, actual Unreal Editor roundtrip, load/accessibility claims and human aesthetic selection separately, with explicit operator review. Their absence cannot be healed by narration or CI green on unrelated instrumentation.

''Release boundary.'' No implicit Elyncia canon promotion, PR merge, second OODA-HA controller, automatic winner or physical safety certification. No resurrection of recursively embedded Markdown or .mem ashes; Git preserves historical testimony and the source/test artifacts preserve engineering evidence.

<<~/ahu>>

